step 1 "@connect newcomer"
rng 51872 4ba9daca
step 2 "Newcomer"
out newcomer "\n\r\n\rTHIS IS A MUD BASED ON.....\n\r\n\r                                ROM Version 2.4 beta\n\r\n\r               Original DikuMUD by Hans Staerfeldt, Katja Nyboe,\n\r               Tom Madsen, Michael Seifert, and Sebastian Hammer\n\r               Based on MERC 2.1 code by Hatchet, Furey, and Kahn\n\r               ROM 2.4 copyright (c) 1993-1998 Russ Taylor\n\r\n\rBy what name do you wish to be known? Did I get that right, Newcomer (Y/N)? "
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 3 "y"
out newcomer "New character.\n\rGive me a password for Newcomer: \xff\xfb\x01"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 4 "secret1"
out newcomer "\n\rPlease retype password: "
rng 51895 7f5599b5
