rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 8 "cleric"
out newcomer "\n\rYou may be good, neutral, or evil.\n\rWhich alignment (G/N/E)? "
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 9 "g"
out newcomer "\n\rDo you wish to customize this character?\n\rCustomization takes time, but allows a wider range of skills and abilities.\n\rCustomize (Y/N)? "
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 10 "n"
out newcomer "\n\r\n\rPlease pick a weapon from the following choices:\n\rmace flail \n\rYour choice? "
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 11 "mace"
out newcomer "\n\r\n\r* You are responsible for knowing the rules (type 'rules').  Ignorance of \n\r  the rules is no excuse.\n\r* Important commands: help, commands, news, notes\n\r* Use the delete command to erase unwanted characters\n\r  \n\r[Hit Return to continue]\n\r"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 12 "@return"
out newcomer "\n\rWelcome to Charm.  Please don't feed the mobiles!\n\rYou have been equipped by Mota.\n\r\n\rAh! Another mortal, seeking adventure.  You should go through mudschool first,\n\rto gain experience to face the trials outside.  Be sure to practice a weapon\n\rin the guild room, or your stay with us shall be very short indeed.  Type\n\r'equipment' to see what your are wielding, 'spells' to see your spells,\n\r'skills' to see your skills, and 'commands' for a list of commands. Help is\n\ravailable on most commands and abilities.\n\r\n\rPlease type 'help rules' to see the Rules of ROM.\n\r\n\rEntrance to Mud School\n\r  This is the entrance to the Merc Mud School.  Go north to go through mud\n\rschool.  If you have been here before and want to go directly to the arena,\n\rgo south.\n\r\n\rA sign warns 'You may not pass these doors once you have passed level 5.'\n\r\nNum          Name Unread Description\n\r==== ============ ====== =============================\n\r( 1)      General [   0] General discussion\n\r( 2)        Ideas [   0] Suggestion for improvement\n\r( 3)     Announce [   0] Announcements from Immortals\n\r( 4)         Bugs [   0] Typos, bugs, errors\n\r( 5)     Personal [   0] Personal messages\n\r\n\rYou current board is General.\n\rYou can only read notes from this board.\n\r\n\r<20hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 13 "score"
out newcomer "You are Newcomer the Believer, level 1, 17 years old (0 hours).\n\rRace: dwarf  Sex: female  Class: cleric\n\rYou have 20/20 hit, 100/100 mana, 100/100 movement.\n\rYou have 5 practices and 3 training sessions.\n\rYou are carrying 5/40 items with weight 17/142 pounds.\n\rStr: 14(14)  Int: 12(12)  Wis: 17(17)  Dex: 10(10)  Con: 15(15)\n\rYou have scored 1400 exp, and have 0 gold and 0 silver coins.\n\rYou need 1400 exp to level.\n\rWimpy set to 0 hit points.\n\rYou are standing.\n\rYou are defenseless against piercing.\n\rYou are defenseless against bashing.\n\rYou are defenseless against slashing.\n\rYou are defenseless against magic.\n\rYou are saintly.\n\r\n\r<20hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
